{"vid":"x5aVSzxy5hA","source":"x5aVSzxy5hA.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Welcome. In this video, we're going to"},{"t":2.5,"txt":"cover one of the most critical safety"},{"t":4.4,"txt":"management tools used in high-risk"},{"t":6.8,"txt":"industries, the permit-to-work system,"},{"t":9.5,"txt":"also known as PTW. It has rightfully"},{"t":12.7,"txt":"been called the backbone of workplace"},{"t":14.4,"txt":"safety, and by the end of this video,"},{"t":16.6,"txt":"you will understand exactly why."},{"t":18.9,"txt":"So, what is a permit-to-work? A"},{"t":21.1,"txt":"permit-to-work is a formal, written"},{"t":23.4,"txt":"system used to control hazardous work by"},{"t":26.1,"txt":"ensuring that all risks are assessed and"},{"t":28.5,"txt":"addressed before starting any high-risk"},{"t":31,"txt":"activity. It is essentially a document"},{"t":34.1,"txt":"that gives official authorization to"},{"t":36.4,"txt":"perform a specific dangerous task only"},{"t":39.2,"txt":"after all necessary safety precautions"},{"t":41.7,"txt":"have been identified, put in place, and"},{"t":43.8,"txt":"verified."},{"t":45.1,"txt":"Without a valid permit, no high-risk"},{"t":47.4,"txt":"work should ever begin. The PTW system"},{"t":50.2,"txt":"is widely used in construction, oil and"},{"t":52.6,"txt":"gas, manufacturing, power generation,"},{"t":55.6,"txt":"and any industry where workers are"},{"t":57.4,"txt":"exposed to serious hazards."},{"t":60.1,"txt":"Now, let's look at the types of work"},{"t":62,"txt":"permits. There are several distinct"},{"t":64.2,"txt":"permit types, each designed for a"},{"t":66.2,"txt":"specific category of hazardous work. The"},{"t":69.3,"txt":"first is the hot work permit. This"},{"t":71.8,"txt":"covers all activities that generate heat"},{"t":74.5,"txt":"or sparks, including welding, cutting,"},{"t":77.7,"txt":"and grinding. On a construction site or"},{"t":80.5,"txt":"in an industrial facility, these"},{"t":82.6,"txt":"activities pose a significant fire and"},{"t":84.7,"txt":"explosion risk, especially near"},{"t":86.8,"txt":"flammable materials or stored gases."},{"t":89.6,"txt":"The hot work permit ensures that fire"},{"t":91.9,"txt":"suppression equipment is ready,"},{"t":93.8,"txt":"flammable materials are removed, and a"},{"t":96.3,"txt":"fire watch is in place. The second is"},{"t":99,"txt":"the cold work permit. This applies to"},{"t":101.4,"txt":"non-heat generating work that still"},{"t":103.9,"txt":"carries hazards, such as mechanical"},{"t":106.2,"txt":"maintenance, painting, or working with"},{"t":108.6,"txt":"pressurized systems. It ensures the work"},{"t":111.4,"txt":"environment is made safe before the task"},{"t":113.6,"txt":"begins. The third is the confined space"},{"t":116.2,"txt":"entry permit. This is issued for any"},{"t":118.8,"txt":"work inside tanks, vessels, pipelines,"},{"t":121.6,"txt":"sewers, or any enclosed space with"},{"t":124,"txt":"limited access. Confined spaces are"},{"t":126.7,"txt":"dangerous because they may contain toxic"},{"t":129.3,"txt":"gases, insufficient oxygen, or the risk"},{"t":132.2,"txt":"of entrapment. The permit requires"},{"t":134.6,"txt":"checks on air quality, the presence of a"},{"t":137,"txt":"standby person outside, and a clearly"},{"t":139.5,"txt":"defined escape and rescue plan. The"},{"t":142,"txt":"fourth is the electrical work permit."},{"t":144.7,"txt":"This is mandatory for any work involving"},{"t":147.3,"txt":"high-voltage systems, electrical"},{"t":149.6,"txt":"maintenance, or live electrical panels."},{"t":152.7,"txt":"It prevents electric shock and"},{"t":154.9,"txt":"electrocution by ensuring the circuit is"},{"t":158,"txt":"properly isolated, locked out, and"},{"t":160.9,"txt":"tagged before work begins."},{"t":164.6,"txt":"Now, let's look at the benefits of the"},{"t":166.4,"txt":"PTW system."},{"t":168.3,"txt":"The diagram highlights six key benefits."},{"t":171.6,"txt":"First, it prevents accidents and"},{"t":173.7,"txt":"injuries by ensuring every hazard is"},{"t":176.4,"txt":"identified before work starts. Second,"},{"t":179.5,"txt":"it enables clear communication. Everyone"},{"t":182.2,"txt":"involved in the job knows exactly what"},{"t":184.3,"txt":"is being done, who is authorized to do"},{"t":186.6,"txt":"it, and what precautions are in place."},{"t":189.2,"txt":"Third, it provides a structured risk"},{"t":191.3,"txt":"assessment and control process that"},{"t":193.6,"txt":"systematically eliminates or reduces"},{"t":196,"txt":"hazards. Fourth and fifth, it ensures"},{"t":199.3,"txt":"proper authorization, meaning only"},{"t":201.4,"txt":"competent and approved personnel perform"},{"t":203.8,"txt":"high-risk tasks."},{"t":205.7,"txt":"And sixth, it maintains compliance and"},{"t":208,"txt":"documentation, creating a paper trail"},{"t":210.4,"txt":"that demonstrates legal and regulatory"},{"t":212.6,"txt":"compliance. Moving on to the key"},{"t":214.9,"txt":"elements of a PTW system, there are"},{"t":217.4,"txt":"three pillars. The first is risk"},{"t":219.9,"txt":"assessment, which involves conducting a"},{"t":222.4,"txt":"job safety analysis, commonly called"},{"t":225,"txt":"JSA, or a job hazard analysis, known as"},{"t":228.5,"txt":"JHA. This step prevents accidents and"},{"t":231.6,"txt":"ensures clear communication about all"},{"t":234.2,"txt":"identified hazards. The second pillar is"},{"t":237.3,"txt":"permit approval, which requires an"},{"t":239.7,"txt":"authorized signature confirming that the"},{"t":241.7,"txt":"risk assessment has been reviewed, that"},{"t":243.9,"txt":"all safety measures are in place, and"},{"t":246.1,"txt":"that the work is approved to proceed."},{"t":248.4,"txt":"The third pillar is safe work"},{"t":250.1,"txt":"procedures, which define the PPE"},{"t":252.3,"txt":"requirements, that is personal"},{"t":254.1,"txt":"protective equipment, along with"},{"t":256,"txt":"step-by-step instructions, identified"},{"t":258.3,"txt":"control measures, and records of safe"},{"t":260.4,"txt":"practices. The closing message of this"},{"t":263.1,"txt":"infographic says it best, \"Always obtain"},{"t":266.6,"txt":"a permit to work before starting"},{"t":268.7,"txt":"high-risk tasks, and keep all workers"},{"t":271.5,"txt":"informed and safe.\" In summary, the"},{"t":274.4,"txt":"permit to work system is not a"},{"t":276.7,"txt":"bureaucratic formality. It is a"},{"t":279.7,"txt":"life-saving protocol that creates a"},{"t":281.8,"txt":"structured barrier between workers and"},{"t":284.2,"txt":"serious harm. Every signature on a"},{"t":287,"txt":"permit represents a commitment to"},{"t":289.3,"txt":"bringing workers home safely at the end"},{"t":291.8,"txt":"of each day. Thank you for watching."},{"t":294.8,"txt":"Safety is not a choice. It is a"},{"t":296.9,"txt":"responsibility."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Welcome."},{"t":1,"w":"In"},{"t":1.2,"w":"this"},{"t":1.48,"w":"video,"},{"t":1.84,"w":"we're"},{"t":2.12,"w":"going"},{"t":2.4,"w":"to"},{"t":2.52,"w":"cover"},{"t":2.88,"w":"one"},{"t":3.08,"w":"of"},{"t":3.16,"w":"the"},{"t":3.24,"w":"most"},{"t":3.52,"w":"critical"},{"t":4,"w":"safety"},{"t":4.36,"w":"management"},{"t":4.96,"w":"tools"},{"t":5.68,"w":"used"},{"t":6.08,"w":"in"},{"t":6.2,"w":"high-risk"},{"t":6.8,"w":"industries,"},{"t":7.8,"w":"the"},{"t":7.92,"w":"permit-to-work"},{"t":8.68,"w":"system,"},{"t":9.48,"w":"also"},{"t":9.8,"w":"known"},{"t":10.16,"w":"as"},{"t":10.4,"w":"PTW."},{"t":11.84,"w":"It"},{"t":12.04,"w":"has"},{"t":12.24,"w":"rightfully"},{"t":12.72,"w":"been"},{"t":12.92,"w":"called"},{"t":13.24,"w":"the"},{"t":13.32,"w":"backbone"},{"t":13.8,"w":"of"},{"t":14,"w":"workplace"},{"t":14.44,"w":"safety,"},{"t":15.16,"w":"and"},{"t":15.28,"w":"by"},{"t":15.44,"w":"the"},{"t":15.6,"w":"end"},{"t":15.76,"w":"of"},{"t":15.84,"w":"this"},{"t":16.04,"w":"video,"},{"t":16.64,"w":"you"},{"t":16.76,"w":"will"},{"t":16.92,"w":"understand"},{"t":17.4,"w":"exactly"},{"t":17.84,"w":"why."},{"t":18.88,"w":"So,"},{"t":19.0